    <parallel-reason>Last task; depends on all</parallel-reason>
    <deps>001,002,003,004,005,006,007,010,011,015,020,021,022,023,024,025,026,030,031</deps>
    <tags>devops</tags>
    <estimated-effort>2-3 hours</estimated-effort>
  </metadata>

  <prompt>Close Phase 0: run the final quality gates, clean the project folder, update README and plan status, write lessons learned, and hand the umbrella on to the Phase 1 child project. Do not archive the umbrella without the owner's go.</prompt>
  <role>SPAARKE platform developer. Follow ADRs strictly. Project closer for the Spaarke delivery process.</role>
  <goal>README.md and plan.md show Phase 0 complete; notes/lessons-learned.md has the Phase 0 lessons; TASK-INDEX.md is all done; the owner has been asked whether Issue #3002 stays open for Phases 1-4.</goal>

  <context>
    <background>task-create Step 3.7. The umbrella continues: Phases 1-4 are child projects (design §4). /devops-project-archive runs only on the owner's go.</background>
    <relevant-files>
      <file role="modify">projects/specialist-legal-agents-r1/README.md</file>
